{"4659230":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"What's the Word","steam_appid":4659230,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4659230\/extras\/57ae775679cb82d37529e50b2a657a4f.avif?t=1793677120\" alt=\"In Game picture with the word Puzzle written\" width=632 height=116 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What’s the Word is a simple word-guessing game built around finding the hidden word using a limited number of attempts. Each guess gives you feedback on the letters you’ve chosen, helping you work out which letters belong in the word, which are in the correct position, and which can be ruled out entirely. From there, it’s about using deduction, vocabulary, and a bit of experimentation to narrow down the possibilities and find the answer before you run out of guesses.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose different word lengths depending on how difficult you want each puzzle to be, making it easy to play something quick or give yourself a harder challenge. Shorter words can be surprisingly tricky, while longer words give you more letters and combinations to think through. Whether you want a relaxed word puzzle or something that makes you stop and think, you can adjust the experience to suit how you want to play.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the center of the game is the Daily Puzzle, with a new word to solve each day. Everyone receives the same daily word, giving you one fresh challenge to come back to every day and see how efficiently you can solve it. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4659230\/extras\/dd98c7f883734d023e0966b6609f422b.avif?t=1793677120\" alt=\"In Game picture with the word Steam written\" width=632 height=116 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want more than just the daily puzzle, there’s also unlimited practice and community content through Steam Workshop. You can play custom word packs, track your stats with achievements, and build up vocabulary over time. It’s a clean, straightforward game that’s easy to jump into and gives you a reason to come back each day.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your keyboard, mouse or touch input to select letters when guessing a word!<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily Puzzle - Same for everyone!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom Word Lists - Create or Download your own from the Steam Workshop<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom Word Length - Have more or fewer letters to set your difficulty<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements - Get Steam Achievements from playing<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4659230\/extras\/57ae775679cb82d37529e50b2a657a4f.avif?t=1793677120\" alt=\"In Game picture with the word Puzzle written\" width=632 height=116 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What’s the Word is a simple word-guessing game built around finding the hidden word using a limited number of attempts. Each guess gives you feedback on the letters you’ve chosen, helping you work out which letters belong in the word, which are in the correct position, and which can be ruled out entirely. From there, it’s about using deduction, vocabulary, and a bit of experimentation to narrow down the possibilities and find the answer before you run out of guesses.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose different word lengths depending on how difficult you want each puzzle to be, making it easy to play something quick or give yourself a harder challenge. Shorter words can be surprisingly tricky, while longer words give you more letters and combinations to think through. Whether you want a relaxed word puzzle or something that makes you stop and think, you can adjust the experience to suit how you want to play.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the center of the game is the Daily Puzzle, with a new word to solve each day. Everyone receives the same daily word, giving you one fresh challenge to come back to every day and see how efficiently you can solve it. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4659230\/extras\/dd98c7f883734d023e0966b6609f422b.avif?t=1793677120\" alt=\"In Game picture with the word Steam written\" width=632 height=116 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want more than just the daily puzzle, there’s also unlimited practice and community content through Steam Workshop. You can play custom word packs, track your stats with achievements, and build up vocabulary over time. It’s a clean, straightforward game that’s easy to jump into and gives you a reason to come back each day.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your keyboard, mouse or touch input to select letters when guessing a word!<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily Puzzle - Same for everyone!<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom Word Lists - Create or Download your own from the Steam Workshop<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom Word Length - Have more or fewer letters to set your difficulty<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements - Get Steam Achievements from playing<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"The word guessing puzzle game that allows you to create and download custom word lists from the Steam Workshop. Challenge yourself with a new daily word each day and unlock achievements along the way! Make the words short or long, from experienced players to young ones just starting out.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4659230\/d0674565314a2cfcfe0f70eb8caa446671478bb8\/header.jpg?t=1793677120","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4659230\/6223d41df6aa4b64c264c969264dacb3ae220967\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793677120","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4659230\/6223d41df6aa4b64c264c969264dacb3ae220967\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793677120","website":"https:\/\/outgg.com\/whats-the-word.html","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 version 21H1 (build 19043) or newer<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> x86, x64 architecture with SSE2 instruction set support, Arm64<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> DX10, DX11, DX12 or Vulkan capable GPUs<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 version 21H1 (build 19043) or newer<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> x86, x64 architecture with SSE2 instruction set support, Arm64<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> DX10, DX11, DX12 or Vulkan capable GPUs<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["Out GG"],"publishers":["Out GG"],"price_overview":{"currency":